                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mbubonya obo, mulalilo umane buyo, wakabweza cinywido, wati, Eci cinywido ngumulongo mupya uuli mubulowa bwangu, kamucita obo, ciindi kufumbwa ncimunywa, kuti cibe ciibalusyo candime. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.11.25",
